# Products endpoints tests

@host = localhost:8080/api/v1

### Create new product
POST {{host}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Screen",
  "productionTime": 24,
  "cost": 500,
  "stock": 5
}

### Get all products
GET {{host}}/products


### Update product
PUT {{host}}/products/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated product"
}

### GET product by id
GET {{host}}/products/3


### Delete product
DELETE {{host}}/products/4


## Bill of material endpoints

### Add material to endpoint
POST {{host}}/products/3/bills
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "materialId": 1,
  "quantity": 5
}

###
POST {{host}}/products/3/bills
Content-Type: application/json

{
"materialId": 4,
"quantity": 2
}

### Get bills of a product
GET {{host}}/products/3/bills